vendored capacity math
======================

capacity.h / capacity.cpp are copied verbatim from the canonical rules repo:

  https://github.com/joannayang371/unified-inventory-rules  (cpp/capacity.{h,cpp})

do not edit them here. change the rule upstream, run its golden-vector tests
(make test), then re-copy:

  cp <unified-inventory-rules>/cpp/capacity.{h,cpp} vendor/oss-capacity/

vantage-net consumes the same rule through the oss-capacity python package, so
the two systems stay in agreement.
